            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"# Rollout order\\n\\nThe ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\n:::ask{#rollout-order urgency=\\\"med\\\" multiple=\\\"false\\\" state=\\\"open\\\"}\\nWhich service moves first?\\n\\n- Ledger first\\n- Mirror first\\n:::\\n\",\"token\":\"sha256:7f418f7dc5f90c7c3d3ed3c28c2e288d5844d1377a528bb67c25ea89cefadd08\",\"version\":1}\n"
